---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { BOOKING_PROGRAMS } from "../../../lib/booking-catalog";
export function getStaticPaths() {
  return BOOKING_PROGRAMS.map((program) => ({
    params: { slug: program.value.split(":")[1] },
    props: { program },
  }));
}
const { program } = Astro.props;
---

<Layout
  title={`${program.title}: planning a consultation`}
  description={`Questions to discuss before considering ${program.title} at Tune Clinic in Seoul.`}
  light
>
  <div class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Care · Clinic programs</p>
    <h1>{program.title}</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Start with your priorities, then discuss whether this clinic program fits
      your visit.
    </p>
  </div>
  <article class="wrap reading">
    <h2>The current clinic outline</h2>
    <p>{program.detail}</p>
    <p>
      This outline reflects Tune Clinic’s published menu. Confirm the current
      components, quantities, price and exclusions with the clinic before
      deciding.
    </p>
    <h2>What I would want to discuss first</h2>
    <p>
      What change matters most to you? What previous treatments and medical
      history should the clinician know about? How much time will you have in
      Seoul, and who can help if you need follow-up after leaving?
    </p>
    <h2>A program is a starting point</h2>
    <p>
      The name of a package does not establish that every component is
      appropriate for you. Ask about the purpose, evidence, risks, recovery and
      alternatives for each proposed treatment. Your assessment may lead to a
      different plan or to no treatment.
    </p>
    <h2>Before committing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Which components are necessary, optional or unsuitable for me?</li>
      <li>What is the full quotation, including possible additional costs?</li>
      <li>What recovery and follow-up should I plan around my travel?</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://tuneclinic-global.com/programs">
        Check current clinic scope and pricing ↗
      </a>
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/book/" data-event="booking_cta">
      Book a clinic consultation ↗
    </a>
    <p class="fineprint">
      General Tune Clinic appointment request. Booking does not guarantee a
      consultation with Dr. Ju or commit you to treatment.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/care/programs/">
        ← All clinic programs
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
